        <mxCell id="mtb" value="Model notes:&#xa;1) PaddleOCR: robust for manga speech bubbles, but errors on stylized fonts.&#xa;2) NLLB/M2M100: supports multilingual translation, but may lose slang nuance.&#xa;3) bge-m3: strong retrieval for mixed short/long text, needs vector index tuning.&#xa;4) Llama 3.1: high answer quality with RAG context, but latency and hallucination risk." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="300" width="1550" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
